.subckt amp_024_smcnr vss vdd vinn vinp vout
C0 outn nzo x_c0
IBS ibias vss dc {x_ibias_val}
R0 nzo vout x_rz
XM0 outp vinn tailp vdd pch_lvt l=x_dut_xm0_l m=x_dut_xm0_m w=x_dut_xm0_w
XM1 outp outp vss vss nch_lvt l=x_dut_xm1_l m=x_dut_xm1_m w=x_dut_xm1_w
